    "abstract": "Parts figure for the fixed leading edge access panel group showing the panel, the bracket set, the bonded doubler and the anchor nut arrangement for both fastener pitches.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the access panel group on the fixed leading edge, including the panel, the bracket set, the bonded doubler and the anchor nut arrangement.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the delivered ninety millimetre fastener pitch with individual anchor nuts; sheet 2 shows the sixty millimetre pitch with the bonded floating anchor nut strip. The panel at item 10 is drilled differently for the two pitches and a post-modification panel will not fit a pre-modification wing. The clip at item 60 is deleted at the new standard and is shown with pre-modification effectivity only."
    },
